<title>USA: Parker to close on acquisitions by Nov. 30.</title>
<headline>Parker to close on acquisitions by Nov. 30.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parker Drilling Co said Tuesday it expects to complete two previously announced acquisitions by November 30.</p>
<p>The two companies it is aquiring include  Quail Tools Inc, a tool rental business based in New Iberia, La. and Mallard Drilling, a barge and offshore platform drilling company.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
